### vars
@baseurl = http://localhost:8000/api
@token = bearer xxx
@uid = 1

### login
POST  {{baseurl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "root",
    "passwd": "root"
}


### logout
POST {{baseurl}}/auth/logout HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username" : "root"
}

### user info check
GET {{baseurl}}/auth/me/{{uid}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
